{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491870-super-intelligent-psions","id":1491870,"title":"Super intelligent Psions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-29T22:28:11-07:00","id":1491870,"title":"Super intelligent Psions","content":"we know how novas get super genius--buy mega intelligence, and they just are. <br /> <br /> But what about psions? You can't do it permanently, because that narratively starts running into the Nova playground, but what methods could say a group of psions use to become even for a short time, as brilliant as a nova?<br /> <br /> My thoughts are as follows:<br /> <br /> 1. Biokenesis, Modify your mind and brain meat to be smarter, likely changing the structure to match the issues of whatever problem you have.<br /> <br /> 2. Hive mind? Using telepaths, knit a group of people together into one whole that is greater than the parts.<br /> <br /> 3. I see... Clairsentiants may be able to literally dig the solution out of the skeins of probability. <br /> <br /> <br /> Any other thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T00:37:30-07:00","id":1491875,"title":"","content":"Biokinesis, Electrokinesis, and Vitakinesis all include ways of boosting Attributes. Combine those with Scale boosting and you\u2019re into beyond human intelligence levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T02:44:33-07:00","id":1491883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NewK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491870-super-intelligent-psions#post1491870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. Biokenesis, Modify your mind and brain meat to be smarter, likely changing the structure to match the issues of whatever problem you have.<br /> <br /> 2. Hive mind? Using telepaths, knit a group of people together into one whole that is greater than the parts.<br /> <br /> 3. I see... Clairsentiants may be able to literally dig the solution out of the skeins of probability.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. As Bunyip said. Applies in different ways to BK, EK, Telepathy and VK, but the idea is empower your cognitive ability somehow.<br /> <br /> 2. We have that in the Mindshare 4 if I am not wrong, Access allows you to use the knowledge and mental capacity of others around you. You cant increase your mental power by using others, but you can coordinate the group better and make all as capable as the best (if not better than the best).<br /> <br /> 3. Not exactly mega mental, I would not allow to increase mental scale of you character with Clair. You have other options to go around and get things done with this approach (Felix Felicis syle).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T11:05:55-07:00","id":1491925,"title":"","content":"Have del Fuego use Biokinesis 7 on himself,and have Bue Li link the clones telepathically. Now, each copy of del Fuego can approach a singular task from multiple angles, while consulting g each other without disturbing each others\u2019 work.<br /> <br /> Not exactly Mega-Intellect, buuuut, that\u2019s what novas do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T11:10:45-07:00","id":1491926,"title":"","content":"